  "body_html": "<h1>Antisymmetric Matrix Games Have Value</h1>\n<p>Let $B$ be a real square matrix satisfying $B=-B^T$. Then the matrix game $B$ has\na value. Equivalently, there exists $x\\in\\Delta(I)$ such that\n$$\n  Bx\\le 0.\n$$</p>",
